/// Parse dotenv-style `KEY=value` lines from a `.env` file.
///
/// Supports:
/// - comments (`# ...` full-line and trailing? — spec says ignore comments `#`; simplest: full-line and inline after value? Let's do: lines starting with `#` after trim are ignored; trailing comments only if preceded by whitespace... to keep simple and predictable, only full-line comments, plus optional `export ` prefix, quotes stripped, inline comments NOT stripped).
